        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/c8e16d4c3378fa88d6838481c0da7c17.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=118 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/3ec869fa5f9aef3606dd9707cd7e2cb4.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/265e70c24b8b396ee851bb238dce0bff.webp?t=1777509585\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/265e70c24b8b396ee851bb238dce0bff.poster.avif?t=1777509585\" class=\"bb_img\" width=607 height=337 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey across the nine realms that branch from Yggdrasill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From magnificent worlds to shadowy depths, each realm is filled with its own atmosphere, dangers, and unique traits. Battle giants, survive in icy labyrinths, cleanse enchanted forests. Every realm flows with its own rhythm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/48b74f98a31455df0d659f502b127677.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you set out, overcome new paths. Discover mysterious dungeons. Use shortcuts. Customize your own journey. Your difficulty is your choice. Will you take the easier path, or chase greater rewards through rising challenges and dare to defy Loki? With permanent upgrades and a dynamic progression system, you will grow stronger with every attempt.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/a7a3460e88ac69de65ed8aa394834ac0.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you forge deep bonds with familiar figures like Thor, Freyja, Heimdall, and Eitri, you will face dark and legendary foes. The interactions you share with each character will shape your story, placing you in the heart of a saga filled with the support of allies and the wrath of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/a138546581c212368cf816785f642aff.webp?t=1777509585\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/a138546581c212368cf816785f642aff.poster.avif?t=1777509585\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=194 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/0841923a0dd7a1015077785f841df983.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by acquiring weapons, abilities, and divine blessings. Combine powers like Tyr’s Spear of Justice and Freyja’s Phantom Ambush to forge your own combat style. Create unique combinations to face every encounter with greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/b2772103fbcc549a9d72ba689cdcb5a9.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragnar will be developed with player feedback in mind. With each update, new characters, weapons, mechanics, and story elements will be added, further deepening and shaping the game world. As we value your thoughts, we will begin in early access and move toward full release together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/104fb9f68499b18ed75512d2837456b5.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand against the chaos Loki has unleashed during Ragnarok and become a shining light in the darkest days of Norse mythology by overthrowing his throne.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/c8e16d4c3378fa88d6838481c0da7c17.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=118 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/3ec869fa5f9aef3606dd9707cd7e2cb4.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/265e70c24b8b396ee851bb238dce0bff.webp?t=1777509585\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/265e70c24b8b396ee851bb238dce0bff.poster.avif?t=1777509585\" class=\"bb_img\" width=607 height=337 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey across the nine realms that branch from Yggdrasill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From magnificent worlds to shadowy depths, each realm is filled with its own atmosphere, dangers, and unique traits. Battle giants, survive in icy labyrinths, cleanse enchanted forests. Every realm flows with its own rhythm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/48b74f98a31455df0d659f502b127677.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you set out, overcome new paths. Discover mysterious dungeons. Use shortcuts. Customize your own journey. Your difficulty is your choice. Will you take the easier path, or chase greater rewards through rising challenges and dare to defy Loki? With permanent upgrades and a dynamic progression system, you will grow stronger with every attempt.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/a7a3460e88ac69de65ed8aa394834ac0.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you forge deep bonds with familiar figures like Thor, Freyja, Heimdall, and Eitri, you will face dark and legendary foes. The interactions you share with each character will shape your story, placing you in the heart of a saga filled with the support of allies and the wrath of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/a138546581c212368cf816785f642aff.webp?t=1777509585\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/a138546581c212368cf816785f642aff.poster.avif?t=1777509585\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=194 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/0841923a0dd7a1015077785f841df983.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by acquiring weapons, abilities, and divine blessings. Combine powers like Tyr’s Spear of Justice and Freyja’s Phantom Ambush to forge your own combat style. Create unique combinations to face every encounter with greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/b2772103fbcc549a9d72ba689cdcb5a9.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragnar will be developed with player feedback in mind. With each update, new characters, weapons, mechanics, and story elements will be added, further deepening and shaping the game world. As we value your thoughts, we will begin in early access and move toward full release together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3309140/extras/104fb9f68499b18ed75512d2837456b5.avif?t=1777509585\" width=607 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand against the chaos Loki has unleashed during Ragnarok and become a shining light in the darkest days of Norse mythology by overthrowing his throne.</p>",
        "short_description": "In this epic Norse myth-inspired roguelike dungeon crawler, wield divine power to challenge Loki and uncover the secrets of the Nine Realms through the branches of Yggdrasil. Grow stronger and reshape Ragnarok’s fate with legendary weapons of the gods.",
